  50:./src/sys_arch.c **** /**
  51:./src/sys_arch.c ****  * @ingroup dhcp4
  52:./src/sys_arch.c ****  * Start DHCP negotiation for a network interface.
  53:./src/sys_arch.c ****  *
  54:./src/sys_arch.c ****  * If no DHCP client instance was attached to this interface,
  55:./src/sys_arch.c ****  * a new client is created first. If a DHCP client instance
  56:./src/sys_arch.c ****  * was already present, it restarts negotiation.
  57:./src/sys_arch.c ****  *
  58:./src/sys_arch.c ****  * @param netif The lwIP network interface
